 "narrative": {
  "northStar": "The Cartographer's Night Journal",
  "overview": "A journal opened under lantern light: night-blue paper, aged-bronze rules, parchment notes and faint contour lines; real in-game captures framed like inventory slots. Gold is rare.",
  "keyCharacteristics": [
   "Dark night-blue canvas with tonal layers instead of cards on cards.",
   "Cinzel capitals for headings, Alegreya Sans for reading.",
   "Captures framed as inventory slots; parchment for the honesty notes.",
